+    Mirrors the CLI ``hermes kanban cost`` subcommand so the dashboard
+    widget can render the same numbers without re-implementing the
+    aggregation SQL. ``group_by`` is one of ``task`` (per-issue, the
+    default), ``day`` (per calendar day UTC), ``assignee`` (per
+    profile), or ``total`` (lifetime one-bucket). ``since`` /
+    ``until`` are unix-epoch seconds; ``task_id`` and ``assignee``
+    narrow the scope.
+
+    Returns the raw ``cost_summary()`` payload — same shape the CLI
+    emits with ``--json``. The dashboard frontend adds the $ formatting.
